<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA SCORE 281 FOR FOUR.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA SCORE 281 FOR FOUR.</headline>
<dateline>BRISBANE, Australia 1997-01-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia scored 281 for four in 50 overs against West Indies in their limited overs World Series match at the Gabba on Sunday.</p>
<p>Score - Australia 281 for four in 50 overs (Mark Waugh 102, Stuart Law 93) v West Indies.</p>
